{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04751","headline":"奉和圣制太行山中言志应制 · 张说","name":"奉和圣制太行山中言志应制","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"六龙鸣玉銮，九折步云端。\n河络南浮近，山经北上难。\n羽仪映松雪，戈甲带春寒。\n百谷晨笳动，千岩晓仗攒。\n皇心感韶节，敷藻念人安。\n既立省方馆，复建礼神坛。\n扈跸参天老，承荣忝夏官。\n长勤百年意，思见一胜残。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"张说","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_04751.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04751","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}